<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fa" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
    <title>Gateway | صفحهٔ شروع</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/__static/css/persian-font.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/__static/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page-shell">
        <header class="topbar">
            <a class="brand" href="/__newtab" aria-label="Gateway">
                <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none"><path d="M7 22V10.5L16 5l9 5.5V22l-9 5-9-5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/><path d="m12 18 4-4 4 4M16 14v9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
                <span class="brand-name" dir="ltr">gateway<span>.</span></span>
            </a>
            <span class="topbar-note"><span></span> فضای مرور شما</span>
        </header>

        <main class="ntp-container">
            <div class="hero-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none"><path d="M11 33V16l13-8 13 8v17l-13 7-13-7Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="m18 26 6-6 6 6M24 20v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
            <p class="eyebrow">یک پنجره، به دنیای وب <span></span></p>
            <h1>از اینجا، <em>هر جایی.</em></h1>
            <p class="intro">جست‌وجو کن، آدرس وارد کن و راه خودت رو پیدا کن.</p>

        <form class="search-box" id="search-form">
            <svg class="search-icon" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="10.8" cy="10.8" r="6.3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/><path d="m15.5 15.5 4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            <input id="search-input" type="text" dir="auto" placeholder="جست‌وجو یا وارد کردن آدرس..." autocomplete="off" required aria-label="جست‌وجو یا وارد کردن آدرس">
            <button type="submit" class="search-submit" aria-label="برو"><span>برو</span><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M19 12H5m0 0 6-6m-6 6 6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button>
        </form>
            <div class="search-hint"><span class="hint-dot"></span> هر چیزی که دنبالش هستی، از همین‌جا شروع می‌شه.</div>
            <div class="divider"><span></span><p>دسترسی سریع</p><span></span></div>
            <div class="shortcuts" aria-label="دسترسی سریع">
                <button class="shortcut" data-target="https://duckduckgo.com/" type="button"><span class="shortcut-icon shortcut-search"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="5.8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="m15 15 4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><span>جست‌وجو<small>DuckDuckGo</small></span><b>↗</b></button>
                <button class="shortcut" data-target="https://fa.wikipedia.org/" type="button"><span class="shortcut-icon shortcut-wiki">W</span><span>ویکی‌پدیا<small>Wikipedia</small></span><b>↗</b></button>
                <button class="shortcut" data-target="https://www.youtube.com/" type="button"><span class="shortcut-icon shortcut-video"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="6" width="18" height="12" rx="4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="m10 9.5 4.5 2.5-4.5 2.5v-5Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span><span>یوتیوب<small>YouTube</small></span><b>↗</b></button>
            </div>
        </main>
        <footer class="footer"><span dir="ltr">GATEWAY ENGINE <i> / </i> WEB EXPLORER</span><span>یه جای تازه برای شروع <span class="footer-star">✳</span></span></footer>
    </div>
    <script>
        document.getElementById('search-form').addEventListener('submit', (event) => {
            event.preventDefault();
            const input = document.getElementById('search-input');
            parent.postMessage({ type: 'ENGINE_NAV', target: input.value }, '*');
        });
        document.querySelectorAll('[data-target]').forEach((button) => {
            button.addEventListener('click', () => parent.postMessage({ type: 'ENGINE_NAV', target: button.dataset.target }, '*'));
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
